&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;2021年６月　弁護士法人たいよう総合法律経済事務所&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 75px; line-height: 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: -70px"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 10px"&gt;　　　　　　代表社員（現任）&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:CareerSummaryInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditorsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors contextRef="FilingDateInstant_jpcrp030000-asr_E03245-000GenshinAkiraMember">（注）４</jpcrp_cor:TermOfOfficeInformationAboutDirectorsAndCorporateAuditors>
